    "note": "2026-08-29 full direct build, runtime, development, and Node registry review completed. h2hdb 0.25.0 is the local breaking exact-tree multi-repository candidate; PyPI latest is 0.24.0, so latest_satisfies=false is intentional and does not claim that 0.25.0 is published. All other latest releases satisfy their declared ranges and publish Python 3.14-compatible files. Official notes show Pydantic 2.13.5 contains validator-plugin reuse, GC traversal, and smart-union bug fixes compatible with the existing BaseModel, SecretStr, and validator usage; build 1.6.0 adds CLI features and robustness fixes, while its removed BuildBackendException exc_info and deprecated build.util helper are unused because this repository only invokes python -m build; Ruff 0.16.5 adds preview-only selectors and ASYNC210, DTZ007, and SIM401 fixes outside the enabled non-preview rule set. Remaining candidates are unchanged from the prior reviewed audit; exact-tree cross-repository gates validate the local h2hdb candidate separately.",
